---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy and Security Policy | CoursesWyn"
  description="CoursesWyn Privacy Policy: how we collect, use, and protect your data. We do not sell your personal information."
  canonical="https://courseswyn.com/privacy"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@graph": [
      {
        "@type": "WebPage",
        "@id": "https://courseswyn.com/privacy",
        "url": "https://courseswyn.com/privacy",
        "name": "Privacy and Security Policy | CoursesWyn",
        "description": "Privacy Policy for CoursesWyn. We do not sell your personal information.",
        "isPartOf": { "@id": "https://courseswyn.com" },
        "dateModified": "2026-07-27",
        "inLanguage": "en-US",
        "mainEntity": { "@type": "PrivacyPolicy", "name": "CoursesWyn Privacy Policy" }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "@id": "https://courseswyn.com/#organization",
        "name": "CoursesWyn",
        "url": "https://courseswyn.com",
        "sameAs": ["https://x.com/CoursesWyn", "https://www.facebook.com/CoursesWyn"]
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>

  <main class="p-root">
    <article class="p-article">

      <header class="p-hdr">
        <h1>Privacy and Security Policy</h1>
        <p class="p-date">Last updated: July 27, 2026</p>
      </header>

      <section class="p-intro">
        <p>This page tells you how CoursesWyn handles your data when you visit our website. We take privacy seriously, keep things straightforward, and do not sell your information.</p>
        <p>CoursesWyn is a Udemy coupon directory. We list verified discount codes for Udemy courses. We are not affiliated with Udemy. We do not require accounts, collect payments, or store personal data beyond what is described below.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="p-sec-hdr">
          <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        </div>

        <p>We collect only the information necessary to operate the site and understand how it is used:</p>

        <ul>
          <li><span class="p-bold">Usage data.</span> Pages visited, time spent, referral source, browser type, and device type. Collected anonymously through analytics.</li>
          <li><span class="p-bold">Contact form data.</span> If you send us a message, we receive your email address and whatever information you include. We use this only to respond.</li>
          <li><span class="p-bold">Affiliate referral data.</span> When you click an affiliate link and enroll in a course, the referral is tracked anonymously to attribute commissions. No personal information is shared.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>We do not collect names, billing addresses, payment details, or any personally identifiable information beyond what you voluntarily provide.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="p-sec-hdr">
          <h2>2. Cookies & Local Storage</h2>
        </div>

        <p>We use first-party cookies and local storage for basic functionality:</p>

        <ul>
          <li>Remember your theme preference (light or dark mode).</li>
          <li>Store a session identifier for analytics attribution.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>We do not use third-party tracking cookies, advertising cookies, or fingerprinting scripts. Google Analytics is configured to anonymize IP addresses and does not share data across Google's advertising network.</p>

        <p>You can disable cookies in your browser settings at any time. The site will still function, though analytics will be less accurate.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="p-sec-hdr">
          <h2>3. How We Use & Share Data</h2>
        </div>

        <p>We use data to improve the site, understand which coupons and categories are most useful, and respond to messages. That is it.</p>

        <p>We do not give or sell personal information about anyone who uses our site. Period.</p>

        <p>Data may be shared only with:</p>

        <ul>
          <li><span class="p-bold">Analytics providers.</span> Anonymized usage data is processed by Google Analytics and stored on their servers.</li>
          <li><span class="p-bold">Email service.</span> If you contact us, your message is handled by our email provider, which stores it subject to their own privacy policy.</li>
          <li><span class="p-bold">Legal requirements.</span> If required by law or valid legal process, we may disclose information.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="p-sec-hdr">
          <h2>4. Your Choices & Rights</h2>
        </div>

        <p>Depending on where you live, you may have these rights regarding your data:</p>

        <ul>
          <li><span class="p-bold">Access.</span> Request a copy of the data we hold about you.</li>
          <li><span class="p-bold">Deletion.</span> Request that we delete your personal information.</li>
          <li><span class="p-bold">Correction.</span> Request that we fix inaccurate data.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>To exercise any of these rights, contact us using the information below. We will respond within 30 days.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="p-sec-hdr">
          <h2>5. Data Security & Retention</h2>
        </div>

        <p>We take reasonable precautions to protect your data:</p>

        <ul>
          <li>The site is served over HTTPS with TLS encryption.</li>
          <li>No personal data is stored on our servers beyond what you submit via contact forms.</li>
          <li>Contact form submissions are retained for up to 12 months, then deleted.</li>
          <li>Analytics data is retained for 26 months per Google Analytics default settings.</li>
          <li>We do not host user accounts, login systems, or payment processing.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="p-sec-hdr">
          <h2>6. Contact</h2>
        </div>

        <p>If you have questions about this policy or want to exercise your data rights:</p>

        <p class="p-contact">
          CoursesWyn<br>
          Email: hello@courseswyn.com<br>
          Web: <a href="/contact">courseswyn.com/contact</a>
        </p>
      </section>

    </article>
  </main>

  <style>
    .p-root { padding: 3rem 1rem 4rem; }
    .p-article { max-width: 48rem; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem; }

    .p-hdr { }
    .p-hdr h1 { font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin: 0; line-height: 1.15; }
    .p-date { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0.5rem 0 0; }

    .p-intro p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
    .p-intro p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    section { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; }

    .p-sec-hdr { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 0.5rem 0; margin: 0; }
    .p-sec-hdr h2 { font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--text); margin: 0; }

    section p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0; }

    section ul { list-style: disc; padding-left: 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.25rem; margin: 0; }
    section li { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }
    .p-bold { font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); }

    .p-contact { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; }
    .p-contact a { color: var(--brand); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
    .p-contact a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .p-root { padding: 2rem 1rem 3rem; }
      .p-hdr h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
    }
  </style>
</Layout>